  "updated_at": "2026-04-06",
  "bio": "Sebastien (Seb) Killink stands out in Boulogne-sur-Mer, France, as a master of the 'sketch' style tattoo, capturing the essence of his subjects with spontaneous and artful strokes. His clients rave about his professionalism, consistently impressed by the meticulous attention to detail and the respectful, composed manner in which he conducts his art at Kill Ink Tattoo Piercing on 202 rue nationale. Whether you're a tattoo enthusiast or a first-timer, Seb's proficiency assures a top-tier experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Boulogne-sur-mer, Hauts-de-france, France"
}